WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.070
THE PRESIDENT IS FACING BLOWBACK
THIS MORNING WHEN IT COMES TO

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:08.675
HOW THEY HANDLED THE CHINESE
SURVEILLANCE BALLOON THAT WAS

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:16.950
SHOT DOWN ON SATURDAY.
TO TALK MORE ABOUT THIS, WE'RE

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.852
GOING TO HAVE THE FORMER
NATIONAL SECURITY ADVISER UNDER

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.254
THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION, JOHN
BOLTON HERE.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:22.789
THANK YOU VERY MUCH, AMBASSADOR,
FOR BEING HERE.

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.391
I THINK THE FIRST QUESTION IS,
DO YOU BELIEVE THAT THEY SHOULD

00:00:25.391 --> 00:00:29.629
HAVE SHOT DOWN THIS BALLOON
SOONER?

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:33.233
&gt;&gt; YES, ABSOLUTELY.
YOU KNOW, WHEN IT WAS FIRST

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:38.838
SIGHTED NEAR ALASKA ON THE 28th
OF JANUARY, ACCORDING TO PRESS

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:44.844
REPORTS NORAD, THE NORTH
AMERICAN SPACE COMMAND, DECIDED

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.779
IT WAS NOT THREATENING.
I WOULD LIKE TO KNOW HOW THEY

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:48.748
KNOW.
THE PAYLOAD FOR THIS BALLOON WAS

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.750
APPARENTLY THE SIZE OF THREE
BUSES.

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:54.120
THAT'S PRETTY BIG.
WERE WE CONFIDENT THERE WAS NOT

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.588
A NUCLEAR WEAPON IN THAT
PAYLOAD?

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.591
WERE WE CONFIDENT IT WAS NOT
CARRYING BIOLOGICAL WEAPONS,

00:00:58.591 --> 00:01:00.994
PATHOGENS OR TOXINS THAT COULD
HAVE BEEN DUMPED INTO A

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:03.296
RESERVOIR OR SPREAD ACROSS CROP
LANDS?

00:01:03.296 --> 00:01:06.266
WHY WERE THEY SO SURE?
AND TWO DAYS LATER, THEY DID

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:08.301
DETERMINE IT WAS AN INTELLIGENCE
THREAT, AND DIDN'T DO ANYTHING

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.404
ABOUT IT, AND DIDN'T TELL THE
PRESIDENT OF THE UNITED STATES

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:18.978
UNTIL THREE DAYS AFTER THE FIRST
CONTACT, WHICH I FIND

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.480
INCREDIBLE.
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE QUESTIONS ABOUT

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.416
THAT, IT WAS JANUARY 31st THAT
THE DEFENSE DEPARTMENT ALERTED

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.152
PRESIDENT BIDEN, THAT'S WHEN HE
ASKED FOR THOSE OPTIONS ABOUT

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.621
POTENTIALLY SHOOTING IT DOWN.
YOU THINK HE SHOULD HAVE BEEN

00:01:28.621 --> 00:01:34.093
TOLD THE DAY IT WAS DETECTED?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK MUCH SOONER.

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:35.728
THERE'S A LOT THAT WE DON'T KNOW
HERE.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.932
AND THE WORDING OF MANY OF THE
STATEMENTS BY ADMINISTRATION

00:01:38.932 --> 00:01:42.235
SPOKESMAN IS SLOPPY.
AND WHEN THE WORDING IS SLOPPY,

00:01:42.235 --> 00:01:46.706
THAT OFTEN MEANS THE UNDERLYING
STORY IS SLOPPY.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.141
THAT'S A SIGNIFICANT DELAY IN MY
VIEW.

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:51.244
AND I WOULD LIKE TO KNOW THE
EXPLANATION.

00:01:51.244 --> 00:01:52.712
I WOULD ALSO LIKE TO KNOW WHERE
IN THE CHAIN OF COMMAND FROM

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:55.515
THAT FIRST SIGHTING, THE FIRST
DETECTION OF THE BALLOON, HOW

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:59.219
FAR UP DID IT GO, WHERE DID IT
STOP, AND WHY DID IT STOP?

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:02.055
&gt;&gt; THE ARGUMENT IS THAT SHOOTING
IT DOWN OVER WATER WAS THE

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:04.991
SAFEST OPTION, BECAUSE WHAT
WE'VE HEARD FROM OFFICIALS IS

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:08.428
THAT THEY BELIEVED THAT IT COULD
HAVE CAUSED DAMAGE TO PEOPLE, IT

00:02:08.428 --> 00:02:10.463
COULD HAVE HURT PEOPLE, TO
BUILDINGS, IT COULD HAVE HURT

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:14.601
PEOPLE IF THEY SHOT IT DOWN
WHILE IT WAS OVER MONTANA OR

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:18.605
IDAHO, FOR EXAMPLE.
DO YOU AGREE WITH THAT

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:19.706
ASSESSMENT?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK WE OBVIOUSLY

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:22.909
HAVE TO BE CONCERNED ABOUT THE
SAFETY OF OUR CITIZENS.

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:24.911
HOW WOULD THEIR SAFETY BE
AFFECTED IF THERE WERE WEAPONS

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:28.848
ON THAT THING THAT WE DIDN'T ACT
WHEN IT WAS TIMELY TO DO SO.

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:35.855
AND WITH ALL DUE RESPECT TO THE
GREAT CITIZENS OF ALASKA AND

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.557
MON
MONTANA, IT'S LESS POPULATED

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:40.260
THAN HERE AT HOME.
WE'VE HAD BOMB SHELTERS BEFORE,

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.096
WE CAN BE PREPARED FOR THIS.
THE GOVERNMENT CAN TAKE

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:44.130
COMPENSATION FOR PROPERTY
DAMAGE.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.165
THERE ARE A LOT OF THINGS THAT
ARE UNANSWERED ABOUT WHAT THE

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:48.101
GOVERNMENT DO.
BUT THERE'S A LOT POSSIBILITY

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:50.536
HERE, TOO.
WE'VE TALKED ABOUT THIS AS IF

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:53.673
SHOOTING IT DOWN MEANS
DESTROYING IT.

00:02:53.673 --> 00:02:56.109
BACK IN THE DAY, BEFORE THERE
WAS ELECTRONIC TRANSMISSION OF

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:59.945
PHOTOGRAPHS FROM SPACE, WE USED
TO DUMP FILM THAT OUR SATELLITES

00:02:59.945 --> 00:03:05.885
HAD TAKEN INTO CANISTERS THAT
CAME BACK TO EARTH AND WERE

00:03:05.885 --> 00:03:08.054
CAUGHT BY AIRPLANES.
I DON'T KNOW THE TECHNOLOGY, IF

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:11.291
WE STILL HAVE IT OR HAVE JUNKED
IT, OR IF IT WAS POSSIBLE HERE.

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:14.193
BUT THE SAYING GOES, WHERE
THERE'S A WILL, THERE'S A WAY.

00:03:14.193 --> 00:03:16.229
CAPTURING THAT PAYLOAD IS GOING
TO BE VERY IMPORTANT.

00:03:16.229 --> 00:03:18.298
WHATEVER WE CAN GET OFF THE
BOTTOM OF THE SEA, IF THERE WERE

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:26.773
SOME OTHER WAY TO HAVE BROUGHT
IT DOWN MORE SLOWLY, IF WE COULD

00:03:26.773 --> 00:03:29.142
HAVE PROVEN THIS WAS CHINESE
INTELLIGENCE GATHERING, WE

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:31.678
SHOULD HAVE TAKEN A CLOSER LOOK
AT IT.

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:35.081
&gt;&gt; THE OTHER THING WE HEARD FROM
THE PENTAGON IS THAT THIS WAS

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:38.784
ACTUALLY HAPPENING BEFORE, WHEN
YOUR BO BOSS, YOUR FORMER BOSS,

00:03:38.784 --> 00:03:41.087
FORMER PRESIDENT TRUMP WAS IN
OFFICE, WE'RE NOW LEARNING FROM

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:43.423
A SENIOR ADMINISTRATION OFFICIAL
WHO SAYS THOSE PREVIOUS

00:03:43.423 --> 00:03:47.927
OCCURRENCES WERE DISCOVERED
AFTER THE TRUMP ADMINISTRATION

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:51.964
LEFT OFFICE.
I THINK YOU AS NATIONAL SECURITY

00:03:51.964 --> 00:03:56.803
ADVISER, HOW CAN A CHINESE SPY
BALLOON GET INTO CHINESE AIR

00:03:56.803 --> 00:04:01.974
SPACE AND SOMEONE LIKE WAS NOT
TOLD, SOMEONE LIKE FORMER

00:04:01.974 --> 00:04:05.478
PRESIDENT TRUMP WAS NOT HOLD,
MARK ASPER WAS NOT HOLD ABOUT

00:04:05.478 --> 00:04:06.713
THIS.
HOW DID THAT HAPPEN?

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:09.248
&gt;&gt; AS FAR AS I KNOW, EVERY TRUMP
ADMINISTRATION OFFICIAL WHO HAS

00:04:09.248 --> 00:04:11.283
BEEN ASKED HAVE SAID THEY DIDN'T
KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT IT.

00:04:11.283 --> 00:04:16.522
I WILL SAY THIS, IF THERE WAS
ANY ACTUAL KNOWLEDGE THAT THESE

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:18.824
BALLOONS WERE OVER THE UNITED
STATES AND HIGHER AUTHORITY

00:04:18.824 --> 00:04:20.526
WASN'T TOLD, THAT'S A SERIOUS
PROBLEM.

00:04:20.526 --> 00:04:22.962
THAT'S A SERIOUS PROBLEM.
THAT'S NOT WHAT THE BIDEN

00:04:22.962 --> 00:04:25.832
ADMINISTRATION IS SAYING.
I WROTE THESE WORDS DOWN.

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:31.270
I WAS SO, SO STUNNED BY THEM.
ONE OFFICIAL TOLD FOX NEWS THAT

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:35.842
THE BALLOONS WENT UNDETECTED,
UNDETECTED.

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:38.244
AND THEN SAID, TWO THINGS CAN BE
TRUE AT ONCE.

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:40.646
THIS HAPPENED AND IT WASN'T
DETECTED.

00:04:40.646 --> 00:04:43.716
IF IT WASN'T DETECTED WHEN IT
HAPPENED, HOW DID WE DETECT IT

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:45.952
MORE RECENTLY?
DID THE BIDEN ADMINISTRATION

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:49.889
INVENT A TIME MACHINE?
WHAT IS THE BASIS OF THIS NEW

00:04:49.889 --> 00:04:52.057
DETECTION?
NOW, I UNDERSTAND THAT THE

00:04:52.057 --> 00:04:57.230
ADMINISTRATION HAS OFFERED TO
BRIEF FORMER NATIONAL SECURITY

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.364
OFFICIALS FROM THE TRUMP
ADMINISTRATION.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:01.133
THEY HAVEN'T CALLED ME.
I'M NOT WAITING BY THE PHONE FOR

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:03.603
IT, ALTHOUGH I WOULD TAKE THE
BRIEFING IF THEY OFFERED IT.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:05.271
I THINK CONGRESS HAS GOT A LOT
OF QUESTIONS HERE.

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:07.673
THIS WAS A BOTCHED EFFORT FROM
THE BEGINNING.

00:05:07.673 --> 00:05:11.477
AND BY THE WAY, THE FACT THAT
THERE WERE EARLIER TRANSITS OF

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:14.980
PART OF THE UNITED STATES
TERRITORY, WHICH I THINK THE

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.216
ADMINISTRATION MADE PUBLIC TO
SAY IT'S NOTHING NEW, DON'T

00:05:17.216 --> 00:05:20.286
WORRY ABOUT IT, PROVES EXACTLY
THE OPPOSITE.

00:05:20.286 --> 00:05:25.057
THE VERY FACT, IF IT IS A FACT,
THAT THE CHINESE HAVE TRIED THIS

00:05:25.057 --> 00:05:29.295
BEFORE SHOULD HAVE ALERTED US
AND SHOULD HAVE CAUSED US TO

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:31.497
TAKE ACTION BEFORE THE BALLOON
CROSSED INTO AMERICAN SOVEREIGN

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:35.468
TERRITORY.
&gt;&gt; NOTABLE TO SAY THAT YOU DO

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:36.736
WANT THAT BRIEFING.
AMBASSADOR BOLTON, WHILE I HAVE

00:05:36.736 --> 00:05:39.705
YOU HERE, I WANT TO ASK YOU
ABOUT WHAT I MENTIONED EARLIER,

00:05:39.705 --> 00:05:42.074
THESE NEW POLLS WE'RE SEEING
FROM ABC AND "THE WASHINGTON

00:05:42.074 --> 00:05:45.912
POST" ON 2024, WHERE IT SAYS FEW
AMERICANS ARE EXCITED ABOUT A

00:05:45.912 --> 00:05:47.613
TRUMP/BIDEN REMATCH.
I KNOW YOU HAVE TOYED WITH THE

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:51.217
IDEA OF RUNNING FOR OFFICE.
HAVE YOU MADE A DECISION ON

00:05:51.217 --> 00:05:53.653
WHETHER OR NOT YOU'RE RUNNING
FOR PRESIDENT IN 2024?

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:57.590
&gt;&gt; I HAVE NOT, BUT I WOULD SAY,
WHETHER I RUN OR NOT, I DO THINK

00:05:57.590 --> 00:06:01.260
NATIONAL SECURITY IS GOING TO BE
A MUCH MORE IMPORTANT ISSUE IN

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:04.797
2024 THAN IN RECENT ELECTIONS.
AND IF THIS CHINESE BALLOON

00:06:04.797 --> 00:06:08.400
INCIDENT PROVES ANYTHING, IT'S
THAT THE PEOPLE OF THE UNITED

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:13.239
STATES NEED TO HEAR MORE FROM
CANDIDATES WHAT THEIR FOREIGN

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:15.575
POLICY VIEWS ARE.
THESE ARE LIFE AND DEATH

00:06:15.575 --> 00:06:18.110
DECISIONS THAT PRESIDENTS MAKE.
I KNOW IT'S NOT BEEN THE SOURCE

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:20.046
OF A LOT OF POPULAR DISCUSSION
IN RECENT CAMPAIGNS.

00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:21.514
THAT'S A MISTAKE FOR THE
COUNTRY.

00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:24.183
THE CANDIDATES NEED TO TALK
ABOUT NATIONAL SECURITY MUCH,

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:26.118
MUCH MORE.
&gt;&gt; DO YOU THINK TRUMP HAS A GOOD

00:06:26.118 --> 00:06:31.591
MESSAGE ON NATIONAL SECURITY?
&gt;&gt; TRUMP DOESN'T HAVE ANY

00:06:31.591 --> 00:06:34.760
MESSAGE ON NATIONAL SECURITY
OTHER THAN THAT HE WOULD BE

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.362
PERFECT, PERFECT PHONE
CONVERSATIONS, PERFECT DECISIONS

00:06:36.362 --> 00:06:38.731
ON THE BALLOON, PERFECT
DECISIONS TO SOLVE THE

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:41.500
RUSSIA/UKRAINE WAR.
IT'S ALL ABOUT DONALD TRUMP.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.136
IT'S NOT ABOUT FOREIGN POLICY.
&gt;&gt; FORMER AMBASSADOR JOHN

00:06:44.136 --> 00:06:46.539
BOLTON, THANK YOU FOR THAT
PERSPECTIVE THIS MORNING.

